{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_9c7238b4b65b","title":"360威胁情报中心","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247509083&idx=1&sn=6db4ea5f0fab35a30d10c28f83173514&chksm=f88b126e4ae4af27478b290faf50268be8b7f71a5d2d7a0e01e4e88eb695a4ef8ac79cb4fc42&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"360威胁情报中心是全球领先的威胁情报共享、分析和预警平台，依托360安全大脑百亿级样本，万亿级防护日志等海量安全数据，整合360漏洞挖掘、恶意代码分析、威胁情报追踪等团队的安全能力，产出高质量的安全威胁情报，驱动安全的防御、检测和响应。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"360威胁情报中心","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM6ZK2DRam9aQ0pxBMyaibQ7dQAv6FGxgBwRibZZUkRlJB4A%2F0","updated":"2026-11-11T09:30:00.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247509083:1","title":"APT-C-35（肚脑虫）组织使用节日主题诱饵对巴基斯坦的攻击活动分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247509083&idx=1&sn=6db4ea5f0fab35a30d10c28f83173514&chksm=f88b126e4ae4af27478b290faf50268be8b7f71a5d2d7a0e01e4e88eb695a4ef8ac79cb4fc42&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"APT-C-35（肚脑虫，Donot）是南亚情报窃取类 APT 组织，长期针对南亚多国政府、军事等涉敏目标持续攻击，攻击手段多样。360 高级威胁研究分析中心捕获其以宰牲节邀请函为诱饵的宏文档攻击，依靠多阶段解密、计划任务持久化，向 C2 回传信息并拉取 DLL 载荷。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXLs57uooLUPML3aY7Wp2ibZbR0QeI4oDGoL45NwEiaAKTp0oQls1NRpJztAbB71QXtSQdru3wibedXeZtMGhlgzCPTmfPvwNnL4cQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-11T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247509069:1","title":"APT-C-36组织使用新型RAT开展攻击活动","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247509069&idx=1&sn=c25306b5d9c104dbd59ed121786e888e&chksm=f8bbdb70416de7df59579475d293f5ad1172c5a17db541c7b586c1c26909ac4a404e8d19599c&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"近期360监测发现，盲眼鹰组织在2026年8月实施了新一轮攻击活动，在本轮活动中，攻击者在攻击过程中混合使用了JavaScript、VB Script、PowerShell等脚本来隐蔽释放和加载载荷，最终使用一种新型远控木马Evolution RAT作为攻击工具，实现对受害者计算机的控制。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXIwcibrqCdGtqmsI1SuvmBM33BZ4A8wiaAnQ97QEmkTnibUDEcW966KBmC1w31rZxu3aQyzJPfC8b3WyIh0BKQMKLgCvJ5HVLdMPQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-27T09:45:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247509028:1","title":"APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织多路径投递攻击活动分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247509028&idx=1&sn=66b3cd8daa9371324409a3daab2d537c&chksm=f8e383009752e47c02064fd125f011f69c2561c81f26b3e86995c9dd4e60071f9a811f6b63e7&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"监测发现Kimsuky组织攻击：攻击者利用钓鱼邮件投递伪装保险金融文档的恶意文件，并污染开源代码仓库实施供应链攻击，目标覆盖韩日越德等国，涉及保险金融、科研等领域。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXJ7gXK03S4TGfDJlWhVOVYrXJR4byVeyALUq5MnzH0Y5Q0yD9cWvSJjiaL5v5txXAt4aicqnweufEQ18F7EErO4EibgnX3yBh96BM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-15T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508942:1","title":"Sorry勒索软件新变种来袭","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508942&idx=1&sn=f827e689d16fb53bf3f2adfe8eea9642&chksm=f8c2e106103226df3511158212434881b9ca2e1332e15d8de47c72fde94c4b553c8d1c98c62d&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"近期360反勒索团队接到多起Sorry勒索家族新变种反馈，感染规模达数千例且攻击仍在持续，加密数据覆盖数据库、备份、文档和源码，样本分析确认该变种正处于快速活跃期而非偶发事件","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXLhRwxeL3pdqkFeibXkHuPibYAufn3taRFLzbwbcvzQs5Z6U4cQfMgrKJBfVQ32S8fCVicyswfSAyggmo5GxYjzicdlrbL31zYUZUs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-25T00:58:23.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508878:1","title":"APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508878&idx=1&sn=d67dbc1305acff320756e665c0c923de&chksm=f853fbbdf1644d0631b130b53789916d76b0f1c461725aecbbbeacbc996cb2213e3154edda9a&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"近期360捕获到 Kimsuky 组织攻击活动，其通过恶意LNK文件和PowerShell投递，经环境检测、内存加载载荷后，利用伪装成Chrome更新的计划任务实现持久化，以达到长期控制目的","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXLIlibHiathWWta6rib5Dz1bvNsperfIXCQD23kfsxSUW9ia96kA0RWbSmZkKLuLI26rTJM8V8ibm9wUCVOuLIZPKyhAjmFRUP8FAF4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-10T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508875:1","title":"APT-C-56（透明部落）近期攻击活动分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508875&idx=1&sn=39ad939372621e4f7bc675dda5b0d7b3&chksm=f8014a59b0284ef2a40e6e74b17eb7a2021c8608f482da4a4438abfb02e3df84c969d8985c51&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"APT‑C‑56（透明部落）为南亚背景 APT 组织，针对印度及周边国家实施网络间谍活动，擅长社会工程投毒，自研 CrimsonRAT 等远控工具。360 高级威胁研究分析中心捕获其两类共用基础设施的载荷，借助 LNK 与脚本链路加载后门，窃取敏感数据。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXI71ibia5b4OmeQkOLGmzDzLibHVWL7rFBNicXialBtS3boKrNhCzbchpQu8myLLBCOH40ZsjeSebFt55oLJ82Zj0quaZWRnPRF6s20%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-03T09:50:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508827:1","title":"UAC-0099利用新型多阶段恶意软件链开展攻击活动","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508827&idx=1&sn=0c211ab15c96ae62693c76c455d31f4e&chksm=f8c388fe5f962297745a3b2f793de19c8c205533fa5bdf66c8fe0e5c58434bbadab5e38c0fc2&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"UAC‑0099长期针对乌克兰实施网络攻击，常完成初始入侵后移交 APT‑C‑13 深度作战。2026 年该组织更新 TTP，构建多阶段攻击链。360高级威胁研究院近期捕获到UAC-0099组织的一次具体攻击活动，并结合其同类样本，分析还原其攻击链全貌。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXKt6KD1hEZx1icsRwgZicXSsgoEefIIdSuAhRQJLem4ic9nh6xU47vgfog8A1zgrfVggIZLSfqcibub2jvT5Bd3jPicoSs19m0nTsoY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-26T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508780:1","title":"APT-C-06（Darkhotel）近期利用朝鲜相关诱饵发起的攻击活动分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508780&idx=1&sn=718830be7fd88519947419b3ed1a5ce6&chksm=f845a8fbd0e5d02c3749a3ffb29dc7c138841b9c9d5139861bf52761ae64ce489bd7b32ea86f&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"APT‑C‑06（Darkhotel）自 2007 年起开展攻击活动，2014 年由卡巴斯基实验室首次披露。该组织以高端酒店网络作为渗透载体，针对周边国家政企高管、国防与电子工业关键机构实施持续性情报窃取攻击。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXKYEHBCflmZZicrcAuEmmYVVMIQI3bCjSapCQibwEibDZoIGMUJvy9Q7eK67wuoJeAxSgV2eyGlNf0sicdzdLvo1vEfFqP16ANkHNo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508763:1","title":"TeamPCP 相关 Shai-Hulud npm 供应链蠕虫攻击活动分析报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508763&idx=1&sn=a6cc5d4497149cd645e4568e9de93878&chksm=f826152d00cc4e3f16faaa83a86765bc5d42bcb034bfa15a2c809a93ee257c6cb5601a826bda&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"2026 年 8 月 4 日，一场代号为 Shai-Hulud（源自载荷中外传仓库描述 \"Shai-Hulud: Here We Go Again\"）的大规模 npm 供应链蠕虫攻击被发现。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXKF6Stv93A9DyUaQ8zpOhT7BprsFHsKmA6CPicDjtqR78vJldrHFJmugbsUSEQKpUh07AM0fJ9joxN9bvccQ8elMaPmdFH5b2r0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-06T11:15:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUyMjk4NzExMA%3D%3D:2247508749:1","title":"APT-C-24（响尾蛇）组织使用application文件钓鱼攻击活动分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMjk4NzExMA==&mid=2247508749&idx=1&sn=c46a8458976b23295f3cfd283145e31b&chksm=f801cd04649b9b35cadb5d9d4adb6a5664f89a8da95175d6ca861758dedfd84a774c30ac17c8&scene=126&sessionid=1795146089#rd","description":"近期，360高级威胁研究院在APT威胁狩猎中发现该组织投递application文件，诱导用户点击后会从远程安装白加黑组件，样本会进行持久化操作，完成对受害主机的敏感信息窃取以及远程控制等行为。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FEmmib7pWXrXL6ib0uj7ibhRGvd8ZuLqJwAfwxyh8o4o8VvrTUqTsIaaYMUUfp6vNZGIFrm3emHI3PmiaGricMTia3iaV9UW4UY27TXf6HCeN650FQU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-05T09:30:00.000Z"}]}